@ERP.ImageService_HostAddress = http://localhost:5003

### Health Check
GET {{ERP.ImageService_HostAddress}}/health

### Readiness Check
GET {{ERP.ImageService_HostAddress}}/health/ready

### Metrics
GET {{ERP.ImageService_HostAddress}}/metrics

### Hello World
GET {{ERP.ImageService_HostAddress}}/hello

### List all images
GET {{ERP.ImageService_HostAddress}}/images

### Get specific image by ID
GET {{ERP.ImageService_HostAddress}}/images/sample-image

### Upload image (multipart/form-data)
POST {{ERP.ImageService_HostAddress}}/images
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="test-image.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./sample-images/test-image.jpg
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### Delete image by ID
DELETE {{ERP.ImageService_HostAddress}}/images/sample-image

### Test through BFF Gateway
GET http://localhost:5000/api/images
X-API-Key: test-api-key-123

### Get image through BFF Gateway
GET http://localhost:5000/api/images/sample-image
X-API-Key: test-api-key-123
